:: Rowan Farmstead Intro
<<location "rowanfarm">>
<<npc Rowan>><<person1>>
You make your way down the worn dirt road and arrive at a small ranch. There is not much land, only encompassing a small patch of farmland, a cottage, and a barn. As you approach you see someone on the porch stand. It's Rowan.
<br><br>
"Oh wow, ya really came! I mean... I knew ya would. I never doubted it for a second." Rowan tries to hide <<his>> obvious excitement. "Come in, come in, make yourself at home."
<br><br>
<<link [[Come inside|Rowan Mintro]]>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: Rowan Mintro
<<npc "Mint Mocha">><<person1>>
As you enter the cottage, you are met by... Mint Mocha?! She looks away from you ashamed. Rowan looks between the two of you confused. "Am I missin' somethin'? What's wrong with ya both?"
<br><br>
Mint Mocha clears her throat before speaking. "I-I'm sorry. After my... failure, my trainer wanted to get rid of me and Rowan took me in..." You can tell from her eyes that she has been crying a lot lately.
<br><br>
You take a moment to explain your relationship with her and Rowan listens quietly nodding along. 
<<if $pronoun is "m">>
Rowan looks confused. "She? Mint here is a stallion, were you not aware?" Mint Mocha's face burns red as Rowan lifts <<his>> skirt revealing <<his>> <<genitals>>. Mint speaks up embarrassed. "<<pShe>> doesn't need to know that! Ugh whatever, yeah I'm a boy so what, you gonna laugh at me or something?" Mint pouts. "You were the one who made the wrong assumption!"
<</if>>
<br><br>
Rowan stands back a few steps before slipping on a pair of work gloves. "Anyway, I got some workin' to do so you two stay outta trouble."
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Rowan Farmhouse]]>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: Rowan Farmhouse
You are inside Rowan's ranch house. The small cabin is only about four rooms, consisting of a combined kitchen, dining, and living room, two bedrooms, and a bathroom.
<br><br>
<<if Time.hour lt 4>>
    The ranch house is quiet. You can hear gentle snoring from Rowan's room.
<<elseif Time.hour lt 6>>
    You can hear quiet rustling by the barn outside.
<<elseif Time.hour lt 8>>
    Rowan and Mint Mocha are sitting at the table for breakfast.
<<elseif Time.hour lt 18 and !Weather.precipitation is "rain" and !Weather.precipitation is "snow">>
    You are alone inside, Rowan and Mint are outside working on the farm.
<<elseif Time.hour lt 18>>
    You are inside, Rowan and Mint are waiting for the storm to die down.
<<elseif Time.hour lt 21>>
    Rowan and Mint Mocha are sitting at the table for dinner.
<<elseif Time.hour lt 23>>
    The ranch house is quiet. Rowan and Mint must be in their rooms.
<<else>>
    The ranch house is quiet. You can hear gentle snoring from Rowan's room.
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<if Time.hour is 6 or Time.hour is 7>>
<<link [[Eat Breakfast with Rowan and Mint (1:00)|Rowan Breakfast]]>><<set C.npc["Mint Mocha"].dom -= 1>><<set C.npc["Mint Mocha"].love += 2>><<set C.npc.Rowan.dom -= 1>><<set C.npc.Rowan.love += 2>><<pass 60>><<endevent>><</link>><<glove>><<ldom>>
<br>
<</if>>
<<if Time.hour is 21 or Time.hour is 22>>
<<link [[Eat dinner with Rowan and Mint (1:00)|Rowan Dinner]]>><<set C.npc["Mint Mocha"].dom -= 1>><<set C.npc["Mint Mocha"].love += 2>><<set C.npc.Rowan.dom -= 1>><<set C.npc.Rowan.love += 2>><<pass 60>><<endevent>><</link>><<glove>><<ldom>>
<br>
<</if>>
<<if Time.hour gte 8 and Time.hour lt 18 and !Weather.precipitation is "rain" and !Weather.precipitation is "snow">>
    <<link [[Spend some time with Rowan (1:00)|Spending Time Rowan]]>><<pass 60>><<endevent>><</link>><<glove>>
    <br>
<</if>>
<<link [[Enter Rowan's Room (0:02)|Rowan Room]]>><<pass 2>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[Enter Mint Mocha's Room (0:02)|Mint Room]]>><<pass 2>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[Leave (0:05)|Rowan Farmstead]]>><<pass 5>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: Rowan Farmstead
<<location "rowanfarm">>
<<if $stress gte $stressmax>>
	<<passoutrowan>>
<<elseif $rowanrecognize isnot 1 and ($transformationParts.horse.tail is "disabled" or $transformationParts.horse.ears is "disabled")>>
    You hear familiar boots approaching, faster than usual.
    <br><br>
    <<link [[Next|TF Recognition - Notices]]>><</link>>
<<else>>
    You are on Rowan's ranch, a small garden grows various plants and you can hear the sound of pigs, sheep, cows, and other animals from the barn.
    <br><br>
    <<if Time.hour lt 4>>
        The farm is quiet in the dead of night, everyone must be sleeping.
    <<elseif Time.hour lt 6>>
        Rowan is out early, feeding the barn animals and milking the cows.
    <<elseif Time.hour lt 8>>
        It must be breakfast time, Rowan and Mint are probably inside.
    <<elseif Time.hour lt 18 and !Weather.precipitation is "rain" and !Weather.precipitation is "snow">>
        Rowan and Mint are both outside doing farmwork.
    <<elseif Time.hour lt 21>>
        Rowan and Mint have headed inside for dinner.
    <<else>>
        The farm is quiet in the dead of night, everyone must be sleeping.
    <</if>>
    <br><br>
    <<rng>>
    <<if $rng gte 90>>
        <<cleareventpool>>
            <<if Time.dayState is "dusk">>
                <<addinlineevent "brush">>
                    <<npc Rowan>><<person1>>
                    The farmhouse porch creaks under Rowan's boots as <<he>> drops down next to you, two mugs of something hot held loosely in one hand.
                    <br><br>
                    <<He>> passes you one without asking if you wanted it.
                    <br><br>
                    "Figured you'd be out here." <<He>> stretches his legs out, settling in like the day's finally done with <<him>>. "You often end up out here once the sun starts goin' down."
                    <br><br>
                    The fields stretch out gold and quiet in front of you, the kind of view that makes the whole day's aches feel worth it.
                    <br><br>
                    <<link [[Lean into <<him>>|Rowan Porch Lean]]>><</link>>
                    <br>
                    <<link [[Keep some distance|Rowan Porch Distance]]>><</link>>
                <</addinlineevent>>
            <</if>>
            <<addinlineevent "brush">>
                <<npc Rowan>><<person1>>
                There's music drifting faintly from the radio in the barn, something slow and a little out of place for the middle of a work afternoon. Rowan catches you swaying to it without realizing and pretends not to notice for about three seconds before <<he>> gives up the act entirely.
                <br><br>
                "C'mere." <<He>> holds out a hand, dust still on <<his>> trousers, looking entirely too pleased with <<himself>>. "Ain't gonna let good music go to waste."
                <br><br>
                <<link [[Take <<his>> hand|Rowan Take Hand]]>><</link>>
                <br>
                <<link [[Play hard to get|Rowan Hard Get]]>><</link>>
            <</addinlineevent>>
        <<runeventpool>>
    <<else>>
        <<if Time.hour gte 8 and Time.hour lt 18>>
            <<link [[Help Rowan with farmwork (1:00)|Rowan Farmwork]]>><<endevent>><<pass 60>><<tending 2>><<tiredness 12>><<set C.npc["Mint Mocha"].dom -= 1>><<set C.npc["Mint Mocha"].love += 2>><</link>><<gglove>><<ldom>><<gtiredness>><<gtending>>
            <br>
        <</if>>
        <<if Time.hour gte 8 and Time.hour lt 16>>
            <<link [[Help Mint with farmwork (1:00)|Mint Farmwork]]>><<endevent>><<pass 60>><<tending 2>><<tiredness 12>><<set C.npc["Mint Mocha"].dom -= 1>><<set C.npc["Mint Mocha"].love += 2>><</link>><<gglove>><<ldom>><<gtiredness>><<gtending>>
            <br>
        <</if>>
        <<if Time.hour gte 16 and Time.hour lt 18>>
            <<link [[Stretch with Mint (1:00)|Mint Exercise]]>><<endevent>><<pass 60>><<stress -10>><<set C.npc["Mint Mocha"].dom -= 1>><<set C.npc["Mint Mocha"].love += 2>><</link>><<gglove>><<ldom>><<lstress>>
            <br>
        <</if>>
        <<link [[Plant plot|Rowan Plot]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
        <br>
        <<link [[Enter Rowan's ranch house (0:05)|Rowan Farmhouse]]>><<pass 5>><<endevent>><</link>>
        <br>
        <<link [[Enter Rowan's barn (0:02)|Rowan Barn]]>><<pass 2>><<endevent>><</link>>
        <br>
        <<link [[Leave (0:10)|Farmland]]>><<pass 10>><<endevent>><</link>>
    <</if>>
<</if>>

:: Rowan Breakfast
<<npc Rowan>><<person1>>
"Don't just stand there, make yourself useful." Rowan shoves a cutting board and a knife in your direction without looking up from the pot on the stove.
<br><br>
The kitchen is small and warm, full of the smell of something simmering that already smells better than it has any right to.
<br><br>
You start chopping. <<He>> glances over, watching your technique with the same critical eye <<he>> uses on the track.
<br><br>
"That's a sorry excuse for a dice. C'mere." <<He>> steps up behind you, reaching around to adjust your grip on the knife, <<his>> chest brushing your back, close enough that you can feel <<him>> breathe.
<br><br>
<<link [[Steal a taste|Rowan Cooking Steal]]>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[Behave|Rowan Cooking Behave]]>><</link>>

:: Rowan Dinner
<<npc Rowan>><<person1>>
You enter the dining room and Rowan guides you to a chair at the small table. Mint Mocha sits poking beside you blushing slightly. You sit together silently as Rowan turns off the stove and makes <<his>> way over with a plate of fresh vegetables and meat.
<br><br>
The three of you sit together at the table and Rowan offers a silent prayer. It does not take long before the plates are cleaned and the table is clear. Rowan and Mint Mocha take a moment of silent peace before returning to their rools.
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Rowan Farmhouse]]>><<set $dailyrowandinner to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>

